{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44245","headline":"冬夜寄温飞卿 · 鱼玄机","name":"冬夜寄温飞卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苦思搜诗灯下吟，不眠长夜怕寒衾。\n满庭木叶愁风起，透幌纱窗惜月沈。\n疎散未闲终遂愿，盛衰空见本来心。\n幽栖莫定梧桐处，暮雀啾啾空绕林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鱼玄机","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44245.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44245","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}